    issue('conditional-noise',[3,4],'N1 is conditional mean zero andN2 is a conditional second-moment upper bound in every fixed direction, not covariance equality or merely a marginal bound. Noise may depend onxi and have dependent coordinates; it need not be Gaussian. In finite dimensions, a common full-measure set for quadratic-form bounds can be recovered from a countable dense set after integrability; preserve original almost-everywhere wording.')
